Adds `turnstone` to the hand-maintained AppList enum that GET /v1/apps is derived from.
Without this the Console never shows the tile, whatever core.yaml says.

Applies on top of vikunja-patches/apl-api.patch, because this lab runs both apps and one
apl-api image has to carry both entries. Apply the vikunja patch first; the context lines
below already include its `- vikunja` line.

diff --git a/src/openapi/app.yaml b/src/openapi/app.yaml
index 3706ba5..4c1e2a9 100644
--- a/src/openapi/app.yaml
+++ b/src/openapi/app.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ AppList:
     - tekton
     - sealed-secrets
     - trivy
+    - turnstone
     - vikunja

 App:
